to be monotonically decreasing in similarities (increasing in
dissimilarities). With \code{alpha = beta} the model is symmetric (Saito's
cluster model for Model III).

The fit is \code{S = sqrt(sum((m_jk - mhat_jk)^2) / sum((m_jk - mbar)^2))}
with disparities \code{mhat_jk} from monotone regression (primary approach to
ties), as in \code{\link[=circle_mds]{circle_mds()}}. \code{S} is minimized over the coordinates and the
